', 'TestDecodeQueryProjectionFields,TestQueryObligationRosterIsComplete')]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 205,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 52,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
