  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"guard removed\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/dirnode\\t0.482s\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 88,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 22,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
