it_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"EncodeRequest-site -> ['TestEveryDerivedArmFiresItsVector', 'TestEveryDerivedArmFiresItsVector/ctor|failUnknownOperation|request_names_an_operation_outside_the_closed_registry|via_EncodeRequest']\\nDecodeRequestFrame-site -> ['TestEveryDerivedArmFiresItsVector', 'TestEveryDerivedArmFiresItsVector/ctor|failUnknownOperation|request_names_an_operation_outside_the_closed_registry']\\na438b0410fdcfc6882b2e6fea40c36e890285cac15f0ee2da68ba28e9b48e221  internal/dirnode/protocol.go\\na438b0410fdcfc6882b2e6fea40c36e890285cac15f0ee2da68ba28e9b48e221  internal/dirnode/protocol.go\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 569,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 143,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
